        "id": 11631
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-09-02T11:47:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you want to simplify code, How about following change?\n\n1. read from the reader and append to the buffer until reaching EOF.\n2. parse the buffer and return the result.\n\nSo there are no needs to worry about comments on 904 and 907.",
      "parentUuid": "d1c1e5c3_585c8d79",
      "revId": "3a3814266fc85474cb874de4068f5561bfed5596",
